e for AI Search","description":"Get discovered on ChatGPT, Gemini, and AI-driven platforms. We position your brand for the future of search and travel discovery."},{"title":"Preopening Marketing","src":"/home/preopening-marketing.webp","cta":"Plan My Hotel Launch","description":"Launch with impact and demand from day one. We create buzz, build positioning, and generate early bookings before your property opens."},{"title":"OTA Management","src":"/home/ota-management.webp","cta":"Optimize My OTA Listings","description":"Maximize OTA performance while reducing dependency. We optimize listings, pricing, and visibility to drive higher revenue."},{"title":"Website Development","src":"/home/website-development.webp","cta":"Build My Hotel Website","description":"Build a high-performance website designed for direct bookings. Fast, mobile-first, and tailored for hospitality conversion."},{"title":"Sales & Marketing Automation","src":"/home/sales-marketing-automation.webp","cta":"Automate My Bookings","description":"Capture, nurture, and convert every lead automatically. We set up systems that turn inquiries into confirmed bookings."},{"title":"Content Creation","src":"/home/content-creation.webp","cta":"Create High-Converting Content","description":"Create content that sells the experience. From visuals to storytelling, we position your property as a must-visit destination."}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-main-border p-5 md:p-6","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-primary","children":["Platforms we manage for hotels ","in Australia"]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2","children":[["$","li","Booking.com",{"className":"rounded-full border border-main-border bg-[#F9FAFB] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-sm text-secondary","children":"Booking.com"}],["$","li","Expedia",{"className":"rounded-full border border-main-border bg-[#F9FAFB] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-sm text-secondary","children":"Expedia"}],"$L36","$L37","$L38","$L3